dependency.integration-point:
Phase 3 calls: PaperlessService.getFieldTaxonomy()
Returns: Field metadata {name, type, rarity, frequency, validation_rules}
Used by: @agent-guidance-expert for query targeting

quick-reference.integration-point:
**Location:** Phase 2 (OCR execution), Phase 4 (Visual queries)

**Pattern:**
```javascript
try {
  result = await circuitBreaker.execute(
    () => visualOcrCall(),
    { timeout: 500, operation: 'visual-ocr' }
  );
} catch (error) {
  if (error.type === 'CircuitBreakerOpen') {
    // Gracefully skip visual operations
    return { result: null, source: 'tesseract-only' };
  }
  throw error;
}
```
